/* The in-combat pause menu. Lives in the combat scene, on a PanelSettings at sortingOrder 75:
   above the HUD (10) and above the end-of-combat panel (50), so it can never be drawn underneath
   either, and below the loading overlay (100), which has to be able to cover it once a restart or
   a return-to-menu transition starts.

   Unlike the end-of-combat backdrop this one is denser (0.65): the game behind it is frozen at
   timeScale 0, so the scene is context, not something the player is still reading.

   Two rules carried over from CombatEndPanel.uss, both load-bearing:
   - hide with 'display: none', NEVER with 'opacity: 0' alone. A transparent but still drawn element
     stays pickable and would eat clicks on the world for the whole combat.
   - the buttons are '.pause-button', not '.menu-button'. The main menu's MainMenu.uss hard-codes
     'position: absolute' and 'font-size: 96px' on '.menu-button', so loading that sheet here would
     blow the layout apart.

   The hover/active transitions are USS, not tweens, on purpose: UI Toolkit transitions run on panel
   time rather than Time.time, so they keep animating while the game is paused. */

.pause-root {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* See the header: display, not opacity, or the panel keeps swallowing clicks while "hidden". */
    display: none;
    opacity: 0;
}

.pause-panel {
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 36px;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
    padding-left: 56px;
    padding-right: 56px;
}

.pause-title {
    color: rgb(255, 69, 61);
    font-size: 68px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    -unity-text-outline-width: 2px;
    -unity-text-outline-color: rgba(251, 68, 60, 0.686);
    text-shadow: -5px 10px 0 rgb(0, 0, 0);
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/Fonts/Jaini-Regular.ttf?fileID=12800000&guid=f87297ce785d8694c9876678ba95904d&type=3#Jaini-Regular");
}

.pause-buttons {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}

.pause-button {
    min-width: 300px;
    height: 58px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    margin-left: 10px;
    margin-right: 10px;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: rgb(236, 240, 248);
    background-color: rgba(255, 69, 61, 0.184);
    border-color: rgb(255, 69, 61);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/Fonts/Tektur-VariableFont_wdth,wght.ttf?fileID=12800000&guid=e781eecbbec6f9a42ad1f7250c665308&type=3#Tektur-VariableFont_wdth,wght");
    transition-property: background-color, scale;
    transition-duration: 0.12s;
}

.pause-button:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 69, 61, 0.365);
    scale: 1.03 1.03;
}

.pause-button:active {
    scale: 0.98 0.98;
}

/* Disabled is styled explicitly because the buttons are switched off on click to block a double
   request: without it a dead button would look identical to a live one. */
.pause-button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
}

/* The destructive choice inside the confirmation popup: filled instead of outlined, so the two
   answers are not two identical rectangles. */
.pause-button--danger {
    background-color: rgba(255, 69, 61, 0.45);
    -unity-font-style: bold;
}

.pause-button--danger:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 69, 61, 0.65);
}

.pause-confirm {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* Same rule as the root: hidden means not drawn, otherwise it would cover the menu it is
       supposed to sit on top of only when asked. */
    display: none;
}

.pause-confirm-panel {
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    padding-left: 40px;
    padding-right: 40px;
    background-color: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.95);
    border-color: rgb(255, 69, 61);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 12px;
}

.pause-confirm-text {
    color: rgb(236, 240, 248);
    font-size: 24px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    white-space: normal;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/Fonts/Tektur-VariableFont_wdth,wght.ttf?fileID=12800000&guid=e781eecbbec6f9a42ad1f7250c665308&type=3#Tektur-VariableFont_wdth,wght");
}

.pause-confirm-buttons {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}
